'''هوراس أوت''' ({{اللغة|en|Horace Ott}}) هو [[كاتب أغاني]] و[[ملحن]] و[[منتج أغاني|منتج أسطوانات]] و[[عازف بيانو]] [[الولايات المتحدة|أمريكي]]، ولد في [[15 أبريل]] [[1933]] في [[سانت ماثيوز (كارولاينا الجنوبية)|سانت ماثيوز]] في [[الولايات المتحدة]].<ref name=scaf>[https://scafricanamerican.com/public/pdf/honorees/102005.pdf Horace Ott, ''South Carolina African American Calendar'']. Retrieved 3 April 2017 {{Webarchive|url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160304053029/http://www.scafricanamerican.com/public/pdf/honorees/102005.pdf |date=4 مارس 2016}}</ref><ref>[http://www.musicvf.com/songs.php?page=artist&artist=Horace+Ott&tab=songaswriterchartstab Songs written by Horace Ott, ''MusicVF.com'']. Retrieved 3 April 2017 {{Webarchive|url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170725120441/http://musicvf.com/songs.php?page=artist&artist=Horace+Ott&tab=songaswriterchartstab |date=25 يوليو 2017}}</ref><ref name=franklin>[https://books.google.co.uk/books?id=e2dHDsQs6xAC&pg=PA86&lpg=PA86&dq=%22Horace+Ott%22+1933&source=bl&ots=2-ZTLKE3eE&sig=SRz6rrUcnMY9KFNBbx3dWaOoOHQ&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwjE-vzqg4nTAhWlIcAKHYXoBcEQ6AEILTAD#v=onepage&q=%22Horace%20Ott%22%201933&f=false Benjamin Franklin V, "Horace Ott", in ''Jazz & Blues Musicians of South Carolina'', Univ of South Carolina Press, 2008, pp.86-95] {{Webarchive|url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170404131931/https://books.google.co.uk/books?id=e2dHDsQs6xAC&pg=PA86&lpg=PA86&dq=%22Horace+Ott%22+1933&source=bl&ots=2-ZTLKE3eE&sig=SRz6rrUcnMY9KFNBbx3dWaOoOHQ&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwjE-vzqg4nTAhWlIcAKHYXoBcEQ6AEILTAD |date=4 أبريل 2017}}</ref>

